! Value
! Measured
! <code>-100</code> says
! <code>-150</code> says
|-
| 0
| stopped
| 0
| 0
|-
| 1
| ~925 rpm
| 2500
| 2200
|-
| 2
| '''stopped''' (no tach pulses)
| 3100
| 2500
|-
| 3
| ~920 rpm
| 3800
| 3300
|-
